        en: "If you have never booked a wellness treatment, Japanese Head Spa is often the easiest way in. You do not undress, you lie on your back throughout, and the area being worked — scalp, neck, shoulders — is not a sensitive one for most people. Many guests who find a body massage too direct come here first for exactly that reason. There is also a practical point: head and neck are the areas that most reliably tighten up with screen work.",
