        en: "Expect the first few minutes not to be relaxing straight away. You are lying somewhere unfamiliar, you can hear water, you feel unfamiliar hands on your head and you are probably still thinking about the journey here. That is normal and takes no effort to fix. Almost every guest describes the same moment: somewhere between the first warm water and the massage at the neck, the shoulders let go on their own. Until then there is nothing to do but stay lying down.",
