        en: "Water temperature, pressure, the position of your head, the volume of the music, whether we talk or stay quiet: you can change any of it at any time. You do not need to give a reason or form a full sentence. 'A bit warmer' or 'a little less' is entirely enough. From our side that is not a disruption; it is the only way to genuinely adapt a treatment to you. Anyone who politely endures an hour goes home with less than was available.",
