        en: "With a gift you often do not know the recipient's preferences. Candle massage is then a reliable choice, because it is calm, warm and undemanding and overwhelms almost nobody. Japanese Head Spa is the more memorable gift for people who struggle to switch off — but bear in mind that it leaves the hair wet, which not every recipient expects. We tend to advise against cupping massage as a gift: the sensation is unfamiliar and not comfortable for everyone.",
